{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_title", "source_sha256": "d47a64115f3f624666a63b623e3fa2a8df000c157fd644393f1329137a5f8d49", "ja": "ヒーローで、アイドル！", "zh": "英雄之姿的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a220cdfb06db61cbebe77d024d5ade07d29ba8f63d6ddfd75fc02a81242c399c", "ja": "センターを任されたものの、何を頑張れば\r\nいいかわからない環。仲間のアドバイスに\r\n混乱しつつも、プロデューサーの言葉で\r\n大好きなレッドとの共通点を見つけ、\r\nセンターの役割を理解する。", "zh": "环被指派为Center，却不晓得该怎么\n努力才好。虽然伙伴给的建议使她陷入混乱，\n但制作人的一席话，让她发现自己和最爱\n的红色战士之间的共通点，\n进而理解了Center的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4c3134ee8a6fee8f2af35ec77affecadd9861892bb171e16ad1b51d86a38ea5b", "ja": "（今日から、環のセンター公演のレッスンだ。\nそのための準備を……あれ？　みんなもう来てるのか）", "zh": "（环的Center公演练习从今天开始，\n要为此做好准备……咦？大家都已经来了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3d2ec0c5129587ed9e80e6547bdd4902b62cfcbd2fc6212a59b87051ecf7f9bf", "ja": "みんな、おはよう！\nずいぶん早いんだな、まだ集合時間前だぞ。", "zh": "大家早安！\n你们来得真早呢，还没到集合时间喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "27fa468c62cc55534e499ce301567ed20cee198eaee3c78410650e2de2e9d74e", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nおはようございます。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "ecf22faedb2c563cbf5b7079f7efa6ab3abb52e4d8873eefe93b9a65d0125bd2", "ja": "わたしたち、みんなで準備運動してたんだよ。\nケガしちゃったら大変だもんね！", "zh": "我们所有人都做完热身运动啰。\n万一受伤就糟糕了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "379288ac1e75270a1d3846a43ec0044c32d9e1ada61abf255078fd4701eba01d", "ja": "たまき、じゅんび運動おわったぞ～！\n……あっ、おやぶんだ！", "zh": "环做完热身运动啰～！\n……啊，是老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "1d19bcf5dc379304c1779ed39af4106e1850dfe9b8a715202eadac150e1cae71", "ja": "{$P$}、おはよう！\n自分たち、もう準備万端だぞ！", "zh": "{$P$}，早啊！\n我们已经做好万全准备了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "c5208f8dff31fe2828062e21f03e9f4c1970bfb7650ff492443b811e1e052d01", "ja": "私もバッチリ！\nねえねえ、何からレッスン始める？", "zh": "我也做好准备了！\n欸欸，要从什么开始练习呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bf393e3df0cd9120b7db755761724b9648340f3907fb30b5209ea321b1ea5243", "ja": "ははは、みんな気合いが入っているな。\n環、初センター頑張ろう！", "zh": "哈哈哈，大家都很有干劲呢。\n环，你第一次当Center，好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "56250fdc04f42bcf42b0cfdc3bd844073ddc85c7364247b3a351bb5e9a1b4901", "ja": "うん！　たまき、がんばる！", "zh": "嗯！环会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "7c0d4ff799f7f2b32a13f20dc47781117e95197daa5ae62179ad94e24822d2eb", "ja": "ところで、おやぶん。\nセンターって、何をがんばればいいの？", "zh": "对了，老大。\n……Center该怎么努力才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "75401ecd8b2094213b5ff51836358e075b91883a1d1b06f1f3e93023183b193d", "ja": "おっと……そうか。そこから\nちゃんと説明しないといけなかったな。", "zh": "哎呀……也是，\n得从基础部分开始好好向你说明才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "006a4b965dbea34db226ca302da891be7bacf4f226c0a5cc167652a60df4f3db", "ja": "うん！\nねえねえ、たまき何すればいい？", "zh": "嗯！\n欸欸，环需要做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "4e0bc7ea2513633d73d2ae63304703d74783198b4f1279c2113961aaea11c653", "ja": "{$P$}、まかせてよ！\n自分たちが、環にセンターの役割を教えるぞ！", "zh": "{$P$}，交给我们吧！\n我们会告诉环Center的职责！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8218b84e191d2ba250d7158ef8888c25004b048946f4d96dc680e6436aef306b", "ja": "響達が？　……よし、それじゃあ、\nひとまずみんなにお願いしようかな。", "zh": "响你们来教吗？\n……好，那就先麻烦各位啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "ff7e2e81f4950ecdec61dad902ad01d784d44b83b8e027726726a7530ee5a5e4", "ja": "うんっ、任せて！\n環、迷った時は、まず経験者に聞くのが一番だぞ！", "zh": "嗯，交给本人吧！\n环，迷惘的时候，最好先请教过来人喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "dde695f363938035c3206d0cebc853d347be4c9bb75b9416c7a44aba794e57a6", "ja": "歌織も海美も育も、もうセンターを経験してるから、\n好きなだけ質問するといいさー！　もちろん自分もね！", "zh": "歌织、海美和育，都有过担任Center的经验，\n你可以尽管问她们啦～！当然问本人也可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "5b976bbd3c54025ce19f1c5bb143ac30bf7a69c2ddb5247d6e6a8995cf74ea8a", "ja": "わかった！　えっと……じゃあ、みんなに聞くね！\nねえねえ、センターって、何すればいいの？", "zh": "知道了！呃……那就来请教大家啰！\n欸欸，Center需要做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "7acab7060595c36b90fc1098777fb7705d7f8c0d18dd7a5d056513eca3f876da", "ja": "そうね……センターが他と違うのは、\nやっぱり、中心になって歌うこと、かしら……？", "zh": "这个嘛……Center和其他人不同的地方，\n就是大家会以你为中心来歌唱，应该吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "0b713ef519a5270103e203c08c63299107174e0dc2fbb9f451515886aff1d5ee", "ja": "あとね、環！\nダンスも、みんなの真ん中で踊るのがセンターだよ！", "zh": "还有呢，环！\nCenter也会站在大家的正中间跳舞喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "7fa39b57470126c222e6a64cb1f81bf7e0b29a6404c8276d751ec5e300ac3423", "ja": "自分がセンターの時は、ダンスで引っ張ってってるぞ。\nみんなが迷わないように、ビシッと決めないとね！", "zh": "本人担任Center时，会用舞蹈引导大家喔。\n必须明确有力地舞动，才不会让大家感到无所适从！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "a8fa0d6033e5a64ac3beafbaefdd27f426ea5a4be557cf9e9251bd9d151730f1", "ja": "わたしは、『みんなのまとめ役』って教わったよ。\nでも、ひとりでがんばらなくていいんだって。", "zh": "我学到的是『要负责带领大家』。\n不过，不必一个人埋头努力喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "1d854af5e04e04a866cc60a6f9c5b1230dc1635ca72180a93668541d9e8ef198", "ja": "えっと……真ん中で歌って、踊って……\n引っ張って、みんなをまとめる……？", "zh": "呃……站在正中间唱歌跳舞……\n负责引导、带领大家……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "bac9674ec6ef9ed60ec0aa3491efbb3a18c83ec45324a8ff8f226b6326d93de6", "ja": "かえって混乱させちゃったかしら……。\nごめんなさい、環ちゃん。", "zh": "反倒让你陷入混乱了吗……？\n真抱歉，小环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "02e86405155268ad7c73dcb749ded9f0f2ba334a6204e018832c2ae5f3dbfef6", "ja": "私たち、いっぺんに言い過ぎちゃった？", "zh": "我们一下子说太多了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "da0e756ff89bb3067ee05a2dfef6600f3200aa1857085faa182adfb07efdecc4", "ja": "うう……おやぶ～ん……。", "zh": "呜呜……老～大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b7b25ea4d257addc9ed06a2bd262614a5357482e021a6859493b4972481af198", "ja": "ああ、混乱しちゃったな。\n環、あんまり難しく考えなくていいんだ。", "zh": "唉呀，陷入混乱了呢。\n环，你不必想得太复杂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "6bae1216f57ecebf4e0d8b1f5ec822cbe7fc6cd7605c68c42145bf202eaf2bbf", "ja": "そうそう、つまり……その日のステージで、\n一番すごいのがセンターなんだ！", "zh": "没错没错，总而言之……\nCenter是那天舞台上最厉害的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "b646f2c208e11312b95942158bc8668da7ee8e2931aba0d283cdf07ddbdb6f64", "ja": "真ん中だし、すっごくカッコイイんだぞ！", "zh": "而且站在正中间，非常帅气喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "481273ab0f1eed0243e326ab0002acf0859748d493393705256ccec82bb10629", "ja": "カッコイイ……？\nうーん……。あっ、ヒーローみたい？", "zh": "帅气……？\n嗯……啊，就像英雄一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "16a156aadbe547aec0d713ec63a2799057f6ef21694431b3167e510e38c70dac", "ja": "あっ、そっか。センターって真ん中だし、\nヒーローだとレッドかもしれないね！", "zh": "啊，对喔，Center就是指正中间，\n换作英雄的话，大概就是红色战士吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1031_040tam", "source_sha256": "cc0e0e8e5025d956a6c75e1a79bc23e6250d94406706b5dc4f3e49ff74f05cab", "ja": "レッド！？\nセンターってレッドなの！？", "zh": "红色战士！？\nCenter就是红色战士吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "43a1b5403aa6ee265bc6718b15fd495fe2142f4987f58f388d14fb26b6114bbc", "ja": "おーっ。さすが育りん、わかってる！\nそうそう、環！　センターはレッドだよ！", "zh": "哦～不愧是育育，很懂呢！\n没错没错，环！Center就是红色战士喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "448b3437585c3148e956427191b508cc747c1b7cb27601a654799e8456a13b09", "ja": "たまき、それならわかる！\nレッドは一番強くて、カッコイイんだぞ～！", "zh": "这样的话环就懂了！\n红色战士是最强大帅气的喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "b884a7ca304630f478886e4704886557dd868dfcbcc4dc1b833dd67f91fe3407", "ja": "レッドはリーダーで、仲間と力をあわせて、\n悪い敵をやっつけるんだ！", "zh": "红色战士是队长，\n要和伙伴同心协力消灭邪恶的敌人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "3d98bf3aaae41d9b2f11cc3eb35c3d03ea5d94f6f423b06e2b6a5b7ae927174a", "ja": "環ちゃんとわたし達、5人でヒーローだね！", "zh": "是小环跟我们，共五个人组成的英雄战队呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1036_040tam", "source_sha256": "7b8a48dff19869587547728c4e89bbac2e99313a0b8832ee82cf8752dcce4380", "ja": "うん！　……あれ？\nでもたまきたち、誰をたおせばいいのかな？", "zh": "嗯！……咦？\n不过环我们，该打倒谁才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1037_052kao", "source_sha256": "587ab585dd8e4bb084e6172c2e1c1a83772d6b81ef32b4715d7492b23065c6dc", "ja": "ヒーローの敵……っていうと、裏でいろんな事を\n計画してそうですよね。ずる賢くて、強くて……。", "zh": "说起英雄的敌人……好像会在背后策划各种事情吧。\n既狡猾又强大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "ea8596cc815f878781882ba6ad2bd081b6b72c1cf2cd3570e042409555b6c4f7", "ja": "ということは……\n敵は、{$P$}！？", "zh": "这么说来……\n敌人是{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_1039", "source_sha256": "7625dcd9bf18fb2d67772784c57633cb3e0dfb259e0424141c5c63dda4290845", "ja": "うっ！", "zh": "唔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2000_p", "source_sha256": "56bc75caa4821798067bffef17feef72365061fcdf74fa1ce235a470cb5d4983", "ja": "うっ！　……いや、惜しいな。たしかに俺は、\n裏でいろんな事を計画してるけど……", "zh": "唔！……不，差一点就猜对了。\n虽然我的确是在背后策划各种事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2001_p", "source_sha256": "c91348083d26edc2a88d832c67d5e45511769e4fb2542b623e25c78900868719", "ja": "でも、目的はヒーローを手伝うため。\nセンターのレッドを手伝うためなんだ。", "zh": "但我的目的是帮助英雄，\n也就是帮助身为Center的红色战士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2002_040tam", "source_sha256": "5a8b5deeab7583f7e0ba9f7f562a420c1fe7a5805290871db4828716350e2212", "ja": "えっ？　それで、そのおやぶんが手伝ってる\nセンターのレッドが、たまきなの？", "zh": "咦？所以老大要帮忙的Center红色战士，\n就是环吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2003_p", "source_sha256": "b4529398cfcfbbb2294df93eacdf00c466b037dc63cb40bdaa2a92de9fff1d4b", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。その前に……環。レッドが\n悪い敵をやっつけたら、町のみんなはどうなる？", "zh": "没错，而在那之前……环，如果红色战士消灭了\n邪恶的敌人，城镇的居民会怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2004_040tam", "source_sha256": "af8e51b79740bb0baadcc8c412754c95c4d5330555609618c27949c3757e83ee", "ja": "えっと……悪い敵がいなくなると、\nイジワルされなくなって、みんなうれしい！", "zh": "呃……邪恶的敌人消失后，\n大家就不会受到欺负，会很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2005_p", "source_sha256": "5814ccf962d522beda69a63af9911aea37b88f004f2fc41578d4a3ac5e93caf4", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nじゃあうれしいと、環はどんな顔になる？", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n那么，很高兴的话，环会露出什么样的表情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2006_040tam", "source_sha256": "abf0aa17893b0b2bc9ee250be2d732d6835399b88442f8b5032ab8568fe37021", "ja": "たまきは、うれしいとニコニコしちゃうぞ～！", "zh": "环一高兴就会笑咪咪喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2007_p", "source_sha256": "d12b2551cd89dc3c8859073ee15eb113b092515a0d78d531bf3229eb422b8fce", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\nアイドルの仕事も、同じだと思わないか？", "zh": "哈哈，没错。\n你不觉得偶像的工作也是一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2008_040tam", "source_sha256": "338f4e302d57afb74f0dbdf284a0f935c56ed51a083ff3413e2de70c9dd116c3", "ja": "えっ…………あっ、あーっ！\nたまき、わかった！", "zh": "咦…………啊、啊～！\n环懂了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2009_040tam", "source_sha256": "46a86e545ee563870a60d074443d716e3c74c7622893bdbad9ea0ff236aa6bc0", "ja": "レッドが悪いやつをやっつけるのは、\n敵をたおしたいからじゃなくて……。", "zh": "红色战士之所以要消灭坏人，\n并不是因为想打倒敌人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2010_040tam", "source_sha256": "25de29d18ff4e15ba9844adae7c72e5c47cad83fbcdd328bc3583f874dd6168c", "ja": "みんなに、ニコニコ笑顔になってほしいからだ！", "zh": "而是因为想让大家都能笑咪咪的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2011_p", "source_sha256": "7f836740f8f1417c816c1f9f162fbf92fb014a7c8f8d40bd2ffd5f53be002aab", "ja": "そう、それが環レッドの役割……\nセンターの仕事だと思うよ。", "zh": "没错，这就是红色战士环的职责……\n也就是Center的工作喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2012_040tam", "source_sha256": "0a7e1561fedf859aae431564daf4ba944c6d318750c6a7affce4ddc65669aad4", "ja": "うん！\nわかったよ、おやぶん！", "zh": "嗯！\n明白了，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2013_040tam", "source_sha256": "c5b5f5b36d45ce5ecd3ddf065bc4cbb94a45e65ed2f3014ffd7e06d725860da8", "ja": "たまき、レッドになって……みんなを笑顔にしたい！\nみんなに、いーっぱいニコニコしてほしいぞ！", "zh": "环想成为红色战士……让大家展露笑容！\n希望让大家脸上都有满满的欢笑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2014_029umi", "source_sha256": "4bc0b2a0af4a1c608761bec836e136c8fabadfc7ec83267eaec69c38f6431f8b", "ja": "そうそう！　そういうことだよ～環！\n{$P$}、いいコト言うね！", "zh": "没错没错！就是这样喔～环！\n{$P$}说的真好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
