{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_033_2020_040tam", "source_sha256": "c610b6771a73918a4b21018e3ed5e8efca97eec91a6440cb1b5c7e499160cbaf", "ja": "あとね、劇場のみんなと、おやぶんと……\nことりと、みさきと、社長も！", "zh": "还有，也会让剧场的伙伴们和老大……\n以及小鸟、美咲和社长都展露笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
